THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL

Two sets of files in this repository are not covered by the licence above,
because they are not this project's to license. Both are redistributed under
the terms their own authors set.

1. AP2 JSON Schemas
   backend/app/ap2/schemas/ap2/**, backend/app/ap2/schemas/ucp/**

   Copied verbatim from the Agent Payments Protocol reference implementation
   at https://github.com/google-agentic-commerce/AP2, revision
   e1ea56db72a6385bce3e5c1112b3a56ce60acb43, and redistributed under the
   Apache License, Version 2.0. A verbatim copy of that licence, and the
   provenance of the files, are in backend/app/ap2/schemas/LICENSE and
   backend/app/ap2/schemas/NOTICE.

2. Catalog photographs
   frontend/public/catalog/*.jpg

   Twelve photographs from Wikimedia Commons, each under its own Creative
   Commons licence: CC0, CC BY 2.0, CC BY-SA 3.0 or CC BY-SA 4.0. Each file
   was resized to 960 pixels wide and is not otherwise modified. The creator,
   licence, source page and original URL of every one is recorded per item in
   backend/config/catalog_image_credits.json and listed in the README.

   The share-alike terms apply to those images and to adaptations of them.
   They do not extend to this project's own source, which is a separate work
   distributed alongside them rather than an adaptation of them.

Third-party packages installed from PyPI and npm are not redistributed here;
they are declared in backend/requirements.txt, backend/pyproject.toml and
frontend/package.json, and each carries its own licence.
